# Development Workflow Standards

## MANDATORY SIMPLICITY DIRECTIVE
- Every feature MUST be explicitly specified in rules
- NO assumptions about features
- NO extra complexity
- NO implementation without rule documentation
- Keep everything minimal and focused

## Core Development Philosophy
1. Balanced Development
   - Maintain balance between testing, features, and performance
   - If we just focused heavily on one aspect, pivot to another
   - Avoid over-optimization in any single area
   - Keep changes minimal and focused
   - Work systematically through battle screen buildout

2. Fresh Context Always
   - AI MUST reset its context each task
   - AI MUST NOT rely on cached knowledge
   - AI MUST re-read documentation as needed
   - AI MUST verify directory context
   - AI MUST review current priorities
   - AI MUST NOT block user progress
   - AI MUST maintain momentum
   - AI MUST make clear decisions

3. Systematic Progress
   - Follow the build-test-validate loop
   - Make minimal required changes
   - Create clear stopping points
   - Allow for progress validation
   - Maintain application stability

